                            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                                <span class="font-semibold text-sm text-white">Siti Nurhaliza</span>
                                <span class="text-[10px] bg-white/10 text-gray-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-mono">Hadir</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-light leading-relaxed mb-2">Happy wedding Fitri & Romeo! Lancar sampai hari H yaa✨</p>
