            <h2 class="font-serif-custom text-4xl mb-3">Romeo & Fitri</h2>
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-gray-400 mb-8 font-display">15 . 11 . 2026</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-light">
                Terima kasih atas doa & restu Anda. <br>
                &copy; 2026 Romeo & Fitri Digital Wedding Invitation.
            </p>
